( https://albiononline.com/news/rites-of-spring-2023 )

Adventurer,

The Rites of Spring are back! For two weeks, Albion is filled with *Colored=
 Eggs* and *Spring Treasure Chests* , which may drop the coveted *Spring Co=
ttontail Egg*. But this time there=E2=80=99s another egg, which can grow th=
e vicious *Caerleon Cottontail*.

We've marked the occasion with a brand-new video:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DkrIaosbfFUk )

The *Rites of Spring* ( https://albiononline.com/news/rites-of-spring-2023 =
) runs until *April 20, 00:00 UTC on Albion East* , and *April 20, 10:00 UT=
C on Albion West*. So head for the open world and see what treasures await.=
 You might find a fierce new friend=E2=80=A6

Refer a Friend and Claim the Steelplate Cougar
----------------------------------------------

Another *Referral Season ( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-apr-2023 =
)* is here, and this time you have the chance to claim the popular *Steelpl=
ate Cougar* with a single referral! Once claimed, it can be used by any cha=
racter on that server ( *either Albion East or West* ).

( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-apr-2023 )

As you may have seen, with the opening of Albion East we introduced changes=
 to the referral system. *Click here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/refer=
ral-apr-2023 ) for a summary.

Don=E2=80=99t forget that when you refer a friend who buys an Albion East F=
ounder Pack, you receive *1,000 Gold* rather than 500. This Referral Season=
 ends at *23:59:59 UTC on April 30,* so invite your friends now!

The Hunter Challenge is Back
----------------------------

Let the hunt begin! All of April, take the *Hunter Challenge* ( https://alb=
iononline.com/news/hunter-challenge-2023 ) : earn points for open-world act=
ivities, unlock chests to get valuable loot, and claim the *Black Panther*.

( https://albiononline.com/news/hunter-challenge-2023 )

The Black Panther is a sleek mount with a fearsome appearance and a powerfu=
l *speed boost spell* that propels it across large distances. Additionally,=
 Avatar Rings, statues, and furniture items are available throughout the mo=
nth.

Get out there, earn Challenge Points, and claim rewards!

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/hunter-challenge-2023 )

